ge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Preserve only manifests from newer releases**\n\nWhen this builder is run against its intended pre-release state, the active manifest identifies issue 1747 rather than 1748. This condition treats every non-1748 manifest as a successor and calls `validate_checked_release`, whose successor path requires `active_manifest[\"issue\"] > ISSUE`, so the materialization command aborts before producing issue 1748. Restrict the preservation path to manifests newer than issue 1748 and allow the authenticated predecessor manifest to proceed to the write loop.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.","created_at":"2026-07-28T23:21:18Z","updated_at":"2026-07-28T23:21:18Z","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1758#discussion_r3669843729","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1758","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3669843729"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1758#discussion_r3669843729"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1758"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3669843729/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":1881,"original_start_line":1881,"start_side":"RIGHT","line":1884,"original_line":1884,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"NONE","original_position":85,"position":85,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments/3670012458","pull_request_review_id":4802859201,"id":3670012458,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOO5D6p87av_Iq","diff_hunk":"@@ -1807,6 +1877,16 @@ def main() -> int:\n             )\n         )\n         return 0\n+    active_manifest_path = repo / OUTPUT_RELATIVE / MANIFEST_NAME\n+    if active_manifest_path.is_file():\n+        active_manifest = read_js